OL,3,GNEWSARaise the Colours member guilty of
OL,4,Adancefloor murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA member of activist group Raise The
OL,7,FColours has been found guilty of
OL,8,Fmurdering a pub landlord who was killed
OL,9,Fby a punch to the neck on the
OL,10,Fdancefloor at a bar.
OL,12,FMatthew O'Gara, 44, was attacked by
OL,13,FBilly Allison in the incident at Rico
OL,14,Fand Loren in Lichfield, Staffordshire,
OL,15,Fon 24 May.
OL,17,FAllison was also found guilty of
OL,18,Fcausing grievous bodily harm with
OL,19,Fintent to O'Gara's friend Adam Cooper,
OL,20,F62, who was punched twice and was left
OL,21,Fwith a fractured eye socket and nose.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
